{"description":"When the Cryptbase spec tasks file is edited (a task checked off), remind the agent to append a dated entry to BUILDLOG.md summarising what was completed and what the tests said. The build log feeds the Kiroween write-up.","name":"Append to build log when a spec task file changes","then":{"prompt":"The Cryptbase tasks file just changed. Append a short dated entry to BUILDLOG.md at the repo root: which task(s) are now checked off, and the latest test result if known. Keep it under five lines.","type":"askAgent"},"version":"1.0.0","when":{"patterns":[".kiro/specs/cryptbase/tasks.md"],"type":"fileEdited"}}